[
  {
    "text": "日々の暮らしの織物",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.09987810123318035,
      "left": 0.35296031617567253,
      "width": 0.29404398938174503,
      "height": 0.025246211069286623
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "毎週土曜日の午前6時30",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.15505268267341019,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.18000383929059288,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "分、最初の客が来るずっ",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.15505268267341019,
      "left": 0.2976508861272911,
      "width": 0.17740645200328464,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "と前から、川辺市",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.17399207582366275,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.1306861548078071,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "場の店主たちはトラックの荷下",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.17399207582366275,
      "left": 0.24833319161356765,
      "width": 0.2287007580768061,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ろしを始め",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.19293146897391528,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.08167885317330749,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "る。この市",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.19293146897391528,
      "left": 0.19932588997906797,
      "width": 0.08167885317330749,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "場は1948年から",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.19293146897391528,
      "left": 0.2810047260365674,
      "width": 0.12568742425628351,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ポプラ通",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.19293146897391528,
      "left": 0.40669213317704284,
      "width": 0.06534310458925778,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "りの4ブロックで開かれており、近所の人によれ",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.21187086212416784,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3527709018042755,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ば、70",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.23081025527442037,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.054659493042685865,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "年以上のあいだ一度も休んだことがない",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.23081025527442037,
      "left": 0.17230653987938407,
      "width": 0.29404382692280584,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "という。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.24974964842467293,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.06534308596180761,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "現在の出店数は約140で、10",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.28099964712258946,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21770679078336203,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "年前の85から大き",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.28099964712258946,
      "left": 0.3353538376200602,
      "width": 0.13633833913112273,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "く増えた。市の2023年の調査によると、通",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29993904027284196,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.32119388633076895,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "常の",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29993904027284196,
      "left": 0.4388409231365294,
      "width": 0.032671551538807915,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "週末には約12,",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3188784334230945,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.10775073367414206,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "000人が訪れ、地域経済に年間お",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3188784334230945,
      "left": 0.2253977739417591,
      "width": 0.24534689941753066,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "よそ4億2000万円の効果をもたらしている(近",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3378178265733471,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.34757614454523367,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "くのカフェや商店の売り上げは含まない)",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.35675721972359953,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.30988951768413714,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.35675721972359953,
      "left": 0.42345262124492683,
      "width": 0.012251833966529025,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "「みんな、私たちが野菜を売っていると思ってい",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3880072184215162,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3567731549463386,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "るんです」と、ここで27年間青果店を営む岡田",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.40694661157176876,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3477231601028335,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "真理子さんは言う。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4258860047220212,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.147021922019307,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "「本当に売っているのは、街",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4258860047220212,
      "left": 0.2605850255800966,
      "width": 0.20697415134329478,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "の中心に出かける理由なんですよ」",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.44482539787227376,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2584318527938931,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。一番の売れ",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.44482539787227376,
      "left": 0.37199495635468266,
      "width": 0.09393067002402819,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "筋は、今も1袋200円のミックスリーフだそう",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4637647910225263,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3358961028750393,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "だ。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.48270418417277877,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.032671551538807846,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "数字も彼女の言葉を裏付けている。市の開かれる",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5149011525282081,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3593868957688051,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "日の歩行者数はほかの土曜日より38%多く、来",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5338405456784606,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.34698804542758094,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "場者の4人に3人が近所の別の店にも立ち寄った",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5527799388287131,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.34873596214396657,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "と答えた。県立大学の経済学者である白井教授",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5717193319789656,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3430511285573054,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "は、これを「波及効果」と呼んでいる。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5906587251292182,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.29306367414501794,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "もちろん、良いことばかりではない。出店料は今",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6219087238271349,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3593868957688051,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "年1月に1日3,500円から5,",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6408481169773874,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.1994760793620566,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "000円に値上げさ",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6408481169773874,
      "left": 0.3171231196296735,
      "width": 0.1309965476870308,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "れ、古くからの店主の中には負担が重いと話す人",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.65978751012764,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3593868957688051,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "も",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6787269032778924,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.016335784327307982,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "いる。最も多い苦情は駐車場だ。最寄りの公共",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6787269032778924,
      "left": 0.13398282113306847,
      "width": 0.3430511285573053,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "駐車場は220台分しかなく、たいてい午前9時15",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.697666296428145,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.35935421747942475,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "分には満車になる。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7166056895783975,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.147021922019307,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "市議会は、5月1日から10月31日まで、さらに2",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7478556882763142,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.35401244478533184,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ブロックを車両通行止めにする案を検討してい",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7667950814265667,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3414175405126263,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "る。賛成派は40店分のス",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7857344745768193,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.18537830877896735,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ペースが増えると主張",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7857344745768193,
      "left": 0.3022085516236629,
      "width": 0.16058060821906733,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "し、反対派は配送や高齢者の移動への影響を心配",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8046738677270718,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3593868957688051,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "している。最近はQRコードで支払う若い客も増",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8236132608773243,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.35097399232032306,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "えた。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8425526540275767,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.04900731875030773,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "今のところ、いつもの光景は変わらない。正午に",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.15505268267341019,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.35938689576880484,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "はパンが売り切れ、花のバケツは半分空になり、",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.17399207582366275,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.3588968193186362,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "噴水のそばではブラスバンド(退職した教",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.19293146897391528,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.30956280017324034,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "師5人",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.19293146897391528,
      "left": 0.8291706045443603,
      "width": 0.04366550855621663,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "組で、",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.21187086212416784,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.048353883483416446,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "「セカンドウィンド」と名乗",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.21187086212416784,
      "left": 0.5638777546095656,
      "width": 0.20828104050452698,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "っている)が",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.21187086212416784,
      "left": 0.7721587779982846,
      "width": 0.09670773122357473,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "演",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.23081025527442037,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.016335784327308006,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "奏している。午後2時には、トラックは再び荷",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.23081025527442037,
      "left": 0.535943588698428,
      "width": 0.33672920296287545,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "物でいっぱいになる。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.24974964842467293,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.1633576892308065,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "通行止め計画に関する公聴会は、3月14日",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.28099964712258946,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.3107226550268739,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "(木)",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.28099964712258946,
      "left": 0.8303304593979939,
      "width": 0.04900731875030754,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "午後7時から市役所204号室で開かれる。意見書",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29993904027284196,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.3543881838447317,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "は今月末まで事務局で受け付けている。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3188784334230945,
      "left": 0.5196078214869281,
      "width": 0.2940438269228054,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "O",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8980111412642123,
      "left": 0.38587620941202,
      "width": 0.012094750488392743,
